cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using the formal proofs or exact computational checks."
type: software
title: "BTP/PBF: formal proofs and exact computational checks"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mañas"
    given-names: "Manuel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3764-5737"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ManuelManas/btp-pbf-verification"
url: "https://github.com/ManuelManas/btp-pbf-verification/tree/2026-10-17"
abstract: >-
  Lean formal proofs, a manuscript-to-Lean correspondence table,
  and exact and high-precision computational checks.
  New checks cover reconstruction with variable initial entries, general
  differential equations, spectral kernels and determinantal asymptotics.
  The stability and spectral results are not formalized in Lean.
